@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontSize 16
skinparam maxMessageSize 280
title Acquisto del cliente — acconto, approvazione, saldo
autonumber
actor Cliente
actor Venditore
control PurchaseService as service
participant DatabaseManager as db
participant VehicleDao as vehicle
participant RequestDao as request
participant BankAccountDao as account
participant SaleDao as sale
participant VehicleEventPublisher as publisher
group initiatePurchase(vehicleId, clientId) — transazione 1
Cliente -> service : dalla ClientDashboardView
service -> db : executeInTransactionWithResult(callback)
note over service,db : Connessione aperta; autocommit=false; callback del servizio.
service -> vehicle : updateStateAtomically(SALE, BLOCKED, conn)
service -> vehicle : findById(vehicleId, conn)
note over service,vehicle
  Legge modello/sconti e calcola il prezzo effettivo.
  Queste letture aprono anche connessioni proprie:
  nessuno snapshot unico del listino.
end note
service -> account : findByClientIdForUpdate(clientId, conn)
service -> account : updateBalance(..., saldo - acconto20%, conn)
service -> request : save(Request SALE con totale/acconto, conn)
db -> db : commit / close
service --> Cliente : richiesta; successo dopo commit
end
group approvePurchase(requestId, salesmanId) — transazione 2
Venditore -> service : dalla SalesmanDashboardView
service -> db : executeInTransaction(callback)
service -> request : findByIdForUpdate(requestId, conn)
service -> request : update(salesmanId, expDate = oggi + 1 mese, conn)
db -> db : commit / close
end
group completePurchase(requestId) — transazione 3
Cliente -> service : paga saldo da Le Mie Operazioni
service -> db : executeInTransaction(callback)
service -> request : findByIdForUpdate(requestId, conn)
note over service,request : Verifica SALE approvata e non scaduta.
service -> account : findByClientIdForUpdate(clientId, conn)
service -> account : updateBalance(..., saldo - (agreedTotal - deposit), conn)
service -> sale : save(Sale SALE non negativa, conn)
service -> request : delete(requestId, conn)
service -> vehicle : updateStateAtomically(BLOCKED, SOLD, conn)
service -> publisher : publishCommitment(event, conn)
note over service,publisher : Observer sincrono cancella test drive futuri prima del commit.
db -> db : commit / close
service --> Cliente : esito; nessun ricalcolo del listino al saldo
end
note over service,db
  Ogni gruppo ha la propria transazione. Eccezione: tenta rollback, close, errore UI.
  Richiesta già rimossa o stato incoerente: nessun secondo addebito riuscito.
end note
@enduml
